{"steamAppId":2230450,"description":"A story-rich, conversation-heavy investigative visual novel with point & click elements where you play as Moses & Plato, two clueless detectives embroiled in a wild case while traveling on the famous luxury train, the Clawville Express. When the client you are supposed to protect, an ambassador on a peace mission, is murdered, you become the main suspect! \nBe the slyest fox detective and find a killer in a race against time. Time progresses as you sniff out clues, eavesdrop on conversations, and interrogate passengers. Can you solve the case before the train reaches the last station? If not, war can break out between the two biggest powers of the Wilderness! \n\nFeatures\nInvestigate - Put your detective skills to the test. Utilize your conspiracy board and connect the suspects while collecting all the clues from them.\n\nUse your animal senses - Use your senses of smell, sight, and hearing, and of course your fox cunning, to uncover the secrets of the passengers. \n\nInterrogate the suspects - 12 travelers are waiting to meet you, and you know very well that they all hold secrets. Can you figure them out? \n\nExplore the train and uncover mysteries - Discover a train full of secrets and mysteries. Each cabin hides something, as do their inhabitants. \n\nRace against the clock - Time is not on your side! Certain actions can take up valuable time, so it’s worth thinking twice about who you talk to and when.\n\nPremium English voice acting - Features a cast of legendary voice actors that brings the world of Wilderness to life.\n\n\"Ladies and gentlemen, all aboard!\"","short_description":"A murder mystery where you are the main suspect! An ambassador on a peace mission has been killed on board the Clawville Express. Time progresses as you sniff out clues, eavesdrop on conversations, and interrogate passengers. Can you solve the case before the train reaches the last station? Or else.","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230450/139b56006956893aba72d80228d17660b43de190/header.jpg?t=1777354713","developer":"The Wild Gentlemen","publisher":"Toge Productions","genre":"Приключенческие игры, Инди","platforms":["Windows"],"modes":["Один игрок"],"playerCount":1,"releaseLabel":"14 апр. 2026 г.","comingSoon":false,"metacritic":null,"metacriticUrl":null,"steam":89,"steamReviewCount":135,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230450/a332931e6f0f2635bbfc386065e407c1106f0df0/ss_a332931e6f0f2635bbfc386065e407c1106f0df0.600x338.jpg?t=1777354713","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230450/a332931e6f0f2635bbfc386065e407c1106f0df0/ss_a332931e6f0f2635bbfc386065e407c1106f0df0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1777354713"},{"id":1,"image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230450/a1920efa5e047a5698bdff0d82a8d9dd93c4dcdb/ss_a1920efa5e047a5698bdff0d82a8d9dd93c4dcdb.600x338.jpg?t=1777354713","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230450/a1920efa5e047a5698bdff0d82a8d9dd93c4dcdb/ss_a1920efa5e047a5698bdff0d82a8d9dd93c4dcdb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1777354713"},{"id":2,"image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230450/4fb0009fb609a9b0c891d622593c0e5e93e9667e/ss_4fb0009fb609a9b0c891d622593c0e5e93e9667e.600x338.jpg?t=1777354713","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230450/4fb0009fb609a9b0c891d622593c0e5e93e9667e/ss_4fb0009fb609a9b0c891d622593c0e5e93e9667e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1777354713"},{"id":3,"image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230450/975dc10d645e7bf29d455859fc46130eac06e29c/ss_975dc10d645e7bf29d455859fc46130eac06e29c.600x338.jpg?t=1777354713","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230450/975dc10d645e7bf29d455859fc46130eac06e29c/ss_975dc10d645e7bf29d455859fc46130eac06e29c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1